%% Legend: store = cylinder. Data classes: identity, business records, money, files, notifications.
flowchart LR
  U[User input] --> SPA
  SPA -->|records, RLS| PG[(Postgres)]
  SPA -->|task/leave/expense/chat/finance actions| FN[Edge Functions]
  FN -->|service role| PG
  PG -->|NUMERIC money via fin_* only| PG
  SPA -->|attachments| ST[(Supabase Storage)]
  SPA -->|client deliverables, token| DR[(Drive disk + MySQL)]
  FN -->|signed token| SPA
  FN -->|notifications rows| PG
  PG -->|Realtime| SPA
  FN -->|push payloads| PS[Push services]
  CL[Client reviewer] -->|feedback| FN
  FN -->|signed image URLs 1h| CL
